{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'D738|D741|S4|D746' docs/CURRENT_STATE.md docs/DECISIONS.md\"","aggregated_output":"docs/DECISIONS.md:1082:| D738 | 2026-11-22 | v13s build rule (council 52–53): code refuses a named defect only where the calculation's structure decides it (direct part+whole sum, two forecast-basis figures or a bypassed shared forecast, part above whole on recomputed values, estimate/forecast at or under the reference, plus S1/S2/S6/S7); indirect forms recorded for readers, who mark the five defects on every reply (an accepted reply with a reader-marked defect stops the blind test); round 53's false refusals fixed | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1085:| D741 | 2026-11-22 | Alex rules D740's reader questions: a guidance-implied growth benchmark is not a second value (\"不算错\"); consensus total × a past quarter's share is not the market's reference (\"不能\"); a total used for a narrower quantity must state its deduction or a supported bound (\"必须写明扣多少\"); S5 enforces the carried share, the request and reader brief carry 1 and 3 | in force | `docs/DECISIONS-log.md` |\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:448:**The one next task: re-run the v13s blind test once with fresh writers and readers, after the reader calibration on Alex's rulings (D740, D741).**\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:455:- **Alex ruled the readers' boundary questions** (D741):\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:460:- **The reader calibration on six stored boundary replies** (`calibration-D741/`) runs before the re-run.\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:466:- **What code refuses** (D738): only the five named defects, where the calculation's own structure decides them, plus broken\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
